  "question": {
    "text": "A balloon rises from rest with a constant acceleration of <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>. A stone is released from it when it has risen to height <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math>. The time taken by the stone to reach the ground is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mi>g</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math>&nbsp;seconds. Then what is the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>?"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "From equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></math><br /><br />Given, <math><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> We have, <math><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>h</mi></msqrt></math><br /><br />When the stone released from this balloon. It will go upward with velocity <math><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow> <msqrt> <mrow> <mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow> </msqrt> </mrow></math><br /><br />In this condition, time taken by stone to reach the ground,<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <mi>g</mi><msup> <mi>t</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <msqrt> <mrow> <mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow> </msqrt> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> <mi>g</mi> </mfrac> </mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math>"
  }
}